{"id":"45e100357eb1d5c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-fixed-point.md","title":"Fixed Point","display":"df-fixed-point — Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fixed-point","aliases":["58-df-fixed-point","Fixed Point"],"display":"df-fixed-point — Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fixed-point</span><span>Fixed Point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point — Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,x\\in V\">\\(f,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FixedPoint}_f\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{FixedPoint}_f\\subseteq V\\)</span> (fixed-point predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FixedPoint}_f(x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in A\\land f(x)=x\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FixedPoint}_f(x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in A\\land f(x)=x\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition uses the graph-determined domain and range of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>, so it does not depend on an unrecorded ambient carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Fixed point: maps to itself</li>\n<li>Banach fixed point: contraction on complete metric space has unique fixed point</li>\n<li>Brouwer: continuous map of closed ball has fixed point</li>\n<li>Schauder: compact convex set in Banach space has fixed point for compact map</li>\n<li>Tarski: monotone function on complete lattice has fixed point</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Granas and Dugundji, Fixed Point Theory</li>\n<li>Dugundji and Granas, Fixed Point Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FixedPoint}_f\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FixedPoint}_f(x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in A\\land f(x)=x\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1201,"backlinks":[{"id":"e74d03ee2e6041ba","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-535","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-fixed-point.md|58-df-fixed-point]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}